      "author": "@PlatAndSprawlTV",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kQb66_r-tkBEn2iZDFhJ2GG4iHBNhSUfLuMmYXH4kfLpzB1eRO46tXEjwegiB59Ph2gg=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "The fact that Puerto Rico began as a volcanic island near Peru and traveled thousands of kilometers to its current location is incredible. I was also surprised by the gravity anomaly near the Puerto Rico Trench and the fact that more Puerto Ricans now live in the mainland United States than on the island itself. It's amazing how much geological, ecological, and cultural history is packed into such a small place.",
