      "text": "Weeepaaaa 🇵🇷🙌🏽 interesting video. I was born in Brooklyn NY, but moved to Toa Baja when I was 4 and then to Guayama with my abuelitos, and back to NY a year later. My abuelo built a casita in Salinas when I was 10, I spent summers there. When I visit I love to stay in the mountains of Naranjito or with family in San Sebastián. I love PR. It’s in my heart and mind always.",
