      "text": "The fact that Puerto Rico has more people living in the mainland US than on the island is fascinating, but also says a lot about its history and relationship with the United States. It’s easy to think of Puerto Rico as just one Caribbean island, when its story, identity, and geography reach far beyond its shores.",
